* #variable= 6 #constraint= 5
* Pigeonhole principle: 3 pigeons in 2 holes (UNSAT)
* Variables: x_ij = pigeon i goes to hole j
* x11=x1, x12=x2, x21=x3, x22=x4, x31=x5, x32=x6
* Each pigeon goes somewhere:
+1 x1 +1 x2 >= 1 ;
+1 x3 +1 x4 >= 1 ;
+1 x5 +1 x6 >= 1 ;
* Each hole has at most one pigeon:
-1 x1 -1 x3 -1 x5 >= -1 ;
-1 x2 -1 x4 -1 x6 >= -1 ;
